## Exception: test recordings

Everything in this repository — the source code, the generated sound cues in
`assets/`, the screenshots, the documentation and the test code — is covered by
the MIT license above.

The test recordings are not. The audio files under `tests/assets/` (currently
`dictation-8min.mp3`) and their transcripts (currently `dictation-8min.txt`) are
recordings of the project author's own voice and speech. All rights to them are
reserved: they may not be copied, redistributed, published, or used to train or
evaluate models without the author's prior written consent. They are part of the
repository only so that the end-to-end tests have a real, long dictation to run
against.
